<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 7.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, AUG 7.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates for leading currencies on Thursday were as follows.</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:	Aug 07	Aug 06   Dec 31 96    CHANGE</p>
<p>								 FROM YR-END</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  293.850     295.050     247.020    18.96 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  307.850     307.600     306.830     0.33 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  156.205     156.015     158.970    -1.74 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   46.306	46.226	47.182    -1.86 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  470.420     470.260     419.180    12.22 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  138.660     138.570     141.685    -2.14 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.972	15.954	16.185    -1.32 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  247.530     246.860     212.430    16.52 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.850	 1.848	1.8880    -2.01 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.543	 1.542	1.5810    -2.40 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  191.810     191.700     183.135     4.74 %</p>
<p>Note: The net change is calculated as the percentage difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December 31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
